sequenceDiagram
  actor Person
  participant Host as macOS host
  participant Work as kanna3-workd
  participant Mux as kanna3d
  participant Agent as The agent
  Person->>Host: Send to Build
  Host->>Work: work.task.send
  Work->>Work: check readiness on N
  alt ready
    Work->>Work: append open assumptions, freeze resulting version
    Work->>Work: enter build, record mutation
    Work->>Mux: layout.move window null
    Note over Mux,Agent: Tabs kept, agent keeps running
    Work-->>Host: work.changed + empty Desk / Line update
    Work->>Work: walk simulated pipeline
    Work->>Mux: end agent when release or done
  else held
    Work-->>Host: not_ready with reason
  end
